//****************************************************************************
// $Module type: Class Package
// $Module name: cRefactorEditorHotKeys
// $Author     : Nils Svedmyr, RDC Tools International, <mailto:support@rdctools.com>
// Web-site    : http://www.rdctools.com
// Created     : 2026-07-27
//
// Description : DFRefactor's copy of the editor hotkey mixin (Nils, 2026-07-27). The library
//               original dispatches to the CodeMax-era verb names; this one dispatches to the new
//               vocabulary on cScintillaEditorBridge / cRefactorEditorCommands, so the editor can
//               leave the old chain behind. The SciControlLib fork keeps its own copy untouched for
//               the Hammer heritage and the other pool apps.
//
//               Deliberately a FAITHFUL copy apart from the verb renames: every DefineOnKey binding
//               is carried across exactly as it was, including the ones whose handlers dispatch to
//               Hammer features DFRefactor does not implement. Those bindings behave here precisely
//               as they behave today, and pruning them is a separate, testable pass - dropping one
//               by accident would silently kill a shortcut with nothing to notice it.
//
//               Renamed verbs, old -> new:
//                 GotoMatchBrace        -> GotoMatchingBrace
//                 SC_LineCut            -> CutLine
//                 SC_LowercaseSelection -> LowerCaseSelection
//                 SC_UppercaseSelection -> UpperCaseSelection
//                 BookmarkToggle        -> ToggleBookmark
//                 BookmarkNext          -> NextBookmark
//                 BookmarkPrevious      -> PreviousBookmark
//                 BookmarkClearAll      -> ClearAllBookmarks
//                 BookmarkJumpToFirst   -> FirstBookmark
//                 BookmarkJumpToLast    -> LastBookmark
//                 RefactorDropSelf      -> DropSelfFromHere
//                 RefactorReIndent      -> ReIndentWholeFile
//                 phoCodeMaxEditor      -> phoEditorControl
//
//               The HKSC_* handler names keep their original spelling: they are the message
//               identities the DefineOnKey table points at, and renaming them buys nothing.
//
// This code is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY;
// without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.
//****************************************************************************
Use VdfBase.pkg
Use ScintillaLexerApi.h.pkg  // the CMD_* command ids
Use cRefactorHotKeys.pkg     // oSciCommandHotKeys, tSciCommandHotKey, CommandHotKeyText,
                             // FindCommand, DataFlexOnKey, HotKeyHasAlt. Named explicitly:
                             // it used to arrive transitively, and the comment here used
                             // to credit cSciLexer.h with tSciCommandHotKey, which never
                             // declared it.
Use RefactorMessageQueue.pkg // DispatchHotkey / DispatchAnyKey - global, no dependencies


Register_Procedure CME_Find
Register_Procedure Properties // the settings dialog - implemented by the host
Register_Procedure CME_FindNext
Register_Procedure CME_FindPrevious
Register_Procedure CME_FindReplace
