    End_Procedure

    /* Quick Marks and Go to definition. Not onPreHotKey, which clears the queue for Alt
       combinations alone: Ctrl+Q is one of the keys Nils saw typing a control character into
       the source (2026-08-03), and until 2026-09-10 the editor claimed it only to swallow it.
       SwallowPendingChar takes the queued character by name, then DispatchAnyKey is the house
       remedy behind it (RefactorMessageQueue.pkg says why both). */
    Procedure HKSC_QuickMarkPush
        Send SwallowPendingChar
        Send DispatchAnyKey
        Send PushQuickMark
    End_Procedure

    Procedure HKSC_QuickMarkPop
        Send SwallowPendingChar
        Send DispatchAnyKey
        Send PopQuickMark
    End_Procedure

    Procedure HKSC_GotoDefinition
        Send SwallowPendingChar
        Send DispatchAnyKey
        Send GotoDefinition
    End_Procedure

